      <Desc>THE ORGANIZATION HELPS TO UP-SKILL, GUIDE, AND CONNECT THE SAN DIEGO REGION TO THE RIGHT ECOSYSTEM RESOURCES, NETWORKS, AND SUPPORT INSTITUTIONS TO GROW AN EQUITABLE ECOSYSTEM, FOSTERING A COHESIVE AND COLLABORATIVE ENTREPRENEURIAL COMMUNITY, THROUGH THE EXECUTION OF THE ANNUAL SAN DIEGO STARTUP WEEK CONFERENCE, AND QUARTERLY 1ST MONDAYS EVENTS. THE EVENTS PROVIDE CONTENT AND EXPERIENCES THAT BRING TOGETHER ENTREPRENEURS, INVESTORS, MENTORS, EXECUTIVES, AND TALENT TO CONNECT, EDUCATE AND INSPIRE THE SAN DIEGO INNOVATION ECOSYSTEM THROUGH KEYNOTES, WORKSHOPS, PANELS, MENTORING, PITCH COMPETITIONS, NETWORKING, EXPO TABLES AND DEMO BOOTHS.</Desc>
